sequenceDiagram
  participant Owner
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API
  participant CS as ClinicSetupService
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Mail as SMTP mail
  Owner->>Web: Fill Create your clinic form
  Web->>API: POST /auth/register
  API->>PG: create user
  API->>CS: createClinicForOwner
  CS->>PG: one transaction - organization, MAIN location, settings, ownership
  CS->>PG: after commit - seed feature flags and system roles
  API->>Mail: send verification link, failure only logged
  API-->>Web: signed in, 30-day session
  Web->>Owner: navigate to /setup
  Owner->>Web: Clinic step, then Location and tax step
  Web->>API: PATCH /account/setup/clinic and /account/setup/location
  Owner->>Web: Finish on Your team step
  Web->>API: POST /account/setup/complete
  API->>PG: onboarding_pending = false
  Owner->>Web: Open link from email
  Web->>API: POST /auth/verify-email
  API->>PG: set email_verified_at, clear token
